Q8 
Find departments where the highest salary is more than ₹60,000, and display:
department
highest_salary
lowest_salary
Sort by highest salary descending.

SELECT department,
MAX(salary) AS highest_salary,
MIN(salary) AS lowest_salary
FROM employees
GROUP BY department
HAVING highest_salary>60000
ORDER BY highest_salary DESC;


